Z||000000||William||12-03-2000||04:55 PM||||Lately, I have going over my choices. I have a tan interior which seems to be disliked by most on this list(I don't think it'a all that bad). I want to do a leather interior but i will need to make up my mind on the color. One day I'm all set on a tan leather interior, the next day I want to go all b lack. The black would look more exotic but I think it could really look horrible if the painted items turned out bad. With either color, I would use mr Mikes seats, visors, doors, acc carpet and a new headliner. The hard plastic would be sprayed by me and the consoles and dash would be done by a shop. What do you guys think? I feel the black would really look nice but would be the most risky...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/1930/intthumb2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.mrmikes.com/images/customers/jaskiint.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.mrmikes.com/images/customers/jaskiseat.jpg"> ||||reg||1
